        {
          "before": "/-- Consequences of three literal full rows (1,x,conjugate x), selected by an\nembedding.  Repeated x values are permitted and no x-value is divided by. -/\ntheorem geometric_rows_moments {H : OAI.MUB6.CMatrix}\n    (hH : OAI.MUB6.IsHadamard H) (\u03c1 : Fin 3 \u21aa Fin 6) (x : Fin 6 \u2192 \u2102)\n    (h0 : \u2200 j, H (\u03c1 0) j = 1)\n    (h1 : \u2200 j, H (\u03c1 1) j = x j)\n    (h2 : \u2200 j, H (\u03c1 2) j = star (x j)) :\n    (\u2200 j, Complex.normSq (x j) = 1) \u2227\n      (\u2211 j, x j) = 0 \u2227 (\u2211 j, (x j) ^ 2) = 0 := by\n  have hb := phaseHadamard_boundary hH\n  have h10 : \u03c1 1 \u2260 \u03c1 0 := fun h => (by decide : (1 : Fin 3) \u2260 0) (\u03c1.injective h)\n  have h12 : \u03c1 1 \u2260 \u03c1 2 := fun h => (by decide : (1 : Fin 3) \u2260 2) (\u03c1.injective h)\n  refine \u27e8?_, ?_, ?_\u27e9\n  \u00b7 intro j\n    simpa only [h1] using hH.1 (\u03c1 1) j\n  \u00b7 simpa only [h1, h0, star_one, mul_one] using phase_row_orthogonal hb h10\n  \u00b7 simpa only [h1, h2, star_star, \u2190 pow_two] using phase_row_orthogonal hb h12\n\n",
          "after": "",
          "count": 1,
          "reason": "Reuse checked GeometricMoments instead of duplicating the row-orthogonality argument."
